OL,3,ABritish man missing after diving into
OL,4,ALake Como to rescue teenager
OL,5,
OL,6,FItalian authorities are searching for a
OL,7,FBritish man who has gone missing after
OL,8,Fdiving into Lake Como to rescue a
OL,9,Fteenager.
OL,11,FThe local coastguard said the man, said
OL,12,Fto be in his late thirties, was
OL,13,Fattempting to rescue two people - a
OL,14,Ffather and his 16-year-old son - who
OL,15,Fwere in distress in the water on the
OL,16,FItalian lake's western shore on Monday
OL,17,Fafternoon, local officials said.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
